<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HAG" style="id">- Biblica® Open Ewe Contemporary Scriptures 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Hagai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hagai ƒe agbalẽ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hagai</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hag</para>
  <para style="mt1">Hagai</para>
  <para style="mt2">ƒe agbalẽ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAG 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɔyɔ hena Yehowa ƒe Gbedoxɔ la tutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 1:1"/>Le Fia Darius ƒe dziɖuɖu ƒe ƒe evelia me le ɣleti adelia ƒe ŋkeke gbãtɔ dzi la, Yehowa ƒe gbe va to Hagai, nyagblɔɖila la dzi na Yudatɔwo ƒe anyigbadziɖulagã, Zerubabel, Sealtiel ƒe vi kple nunɔlagã Yosua, Yehozadak ƒe vi dzi.<verse eid="HAG 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 1:2"/>Ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi: “Ame siawo le gbɔgblɔm be, ‘Ɣeyiɣi mede ne woagbugbɔ nye gbedoxɔ atu o.’ ”<verse eid="HAG 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 1:3"/>Tete Yehowa ƒe gbe va to Nyagblɔɖila Hagai dzi be, <verse eid="HAG 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 1:4"/>“Ɖe ɣeyiɣi de be miawo ya mianɔ aƒe nyuiwo me esi nye gbedoxɔ ƒe glikpowo gale nenema koa?”<verse eid="HAG 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 1:5"/>Azɔ la Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔ be, “Mibu ta me nyuie tso miaƒe zɔzɔme ŋuti. <verse eid="HAG 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 1:6"/>Mieƒãa nuku taŋtaŋ gake nuku ʋɛ aɖewo ko mieŋena. Mieɖua nu gake meɖia ƒo na mi o. Mienoa nu gake meɖia kɔ na mi o, mietaa avɔ gake medea dzo lãme na mi o. Miexɔa fetu ke ɖeko mietsɔnɛ dea kotoku ŋɔŋɔ me.”<verse eid="HAG 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 1:7"/>Ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi, “Mibu ta me nyuie tso miaƒe zɔzɔme ŋu. <verse eid="HAG 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 1:8"/>Miyi ɖe towo dzi ne miatso atiwo vɛ ne miatsɔ agbugbɔ atu nye gbedoxɔe. Ekema makpɔ ŋudzedze le eŋuti wòade bubu ŋunye.” Yehowae gblɔe. <verse eid="HAG 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 1:9"/>“Miele mɔ kpɔm na nu geɖe, ke nu ʋɛ aɖe ko miekpɔ, eye ne mietsɔe va aƒe mee la, meɖoa ƒuƒu ɖee, eye metɔna ɖe mia si o. Nu ka tae?” Yehowa Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae gblɔe. “Elabena nye gbedoxɔ ganye gli gbagbã li ko, ke mia dome ame sia ame le ʋiʋlim be miatso aƒe nyuiwo na mia ɖokuiwo. <verse eid="HAG 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 1:10"/>Esia tae dziƒowo te zãmu mi eye anyigba gbe nukuwo nana mi ɖo. <verse eid="HAG 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 1:11"/>Meɖe gbe be ku neɖi le agblewo kple towo dzi. Kuɖiɖi ana bli, wain yeye, ami kple miaƒe agblemenu bubuwo nagblẽ. Kuɖiɖi la nava amegbetɔwo, lãwo kple amegbetɔwo ƒe asinudɔwɔwɔ ɖe sia ɖe dzi.”<verse eid="HAG 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 1:12"/>Tete Zerubabel, Sealtiel ƒe vi, Yosua, Yehozadak ƒe vi, nunɔlagã kple ame mamlɛawo katã ɖo to Nyagblɔɖila Hagai ƒe gbedeasi si wòxɔ tso Yehowa, woƒe Mawu la gbɔ elabena woxɔe se be Yehowa, woƒe Mawu lae dɔe eya ta ameawo vɔ̃ Yehowa eye wosubɔe.<verse eid="HAG 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 1:13"/>Le esia megbe la, Hagai, Yehowa ƒe ame dɔdɔ, tsɔ Yehowa ƒe gbedeasi sia na ameawo, “Meli kpli mi,” Yehowae gblɔe. <verse eid="HAG 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 1:14"/>Ale Yehowa de dzo Zerubabel, Sealtiel ƒe vi, ame si nye Yudatɔwo ƒe anyigbadziɖulagã kple Yosua, Yehozadak ƒe vi, nunɔlagã la kple ame mamlɛawo ƒe gbɔgbɔ me. Woƒo ƒu eye wodze Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ, woƒe Mawu la ƒe gbedoxɔ tutu gɔme <verse eid="HAG 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 1:15"/>le ɣleti adelia ƒe ŋkeke blaeve-vɔ-enelia dzi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="HAG 1:15">Mawu do ŋutikɔkɔe ŋugbe na Gbedoxɔ yeye la</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAG 1:15">Le Fia Darius ƒe dziɖuɖu ƒe ƒe evelia me,<verse eid="HAG 1:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAG 2"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 2:1"/>Le ɣleti adrelia ƒe ŋkeke blaeve-vɔ-ɖekɛlia gbe la, Yehowa ƒe gbe va to Nyagblɔɖila Hagai dzi be, <verse eid="HAG 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 2:2"/>“Gblɔ na Zerubabel, Sealtiel ƒe vi, ame si nye Yudatɔwo ƒe anyigbadziɖulagã kple nunɔlaga Yosua, Yehozadak ƒe vi kple Yudatɔwo ƒe ame mamlɛawo eye nàbia wo be, <verse eid="HAG 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 2:3"/>‘Mia dometɔ kae ate ŋu aɖo ŋku ale si gbedoxɔ la ƒe atsyɔ̃ nɔ tsã la dzi? Aleke miele esia kpɔm fifiae? Ɖe wòɖi nane le mia ŋkumea? <verse eid="HAG 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 2:4"/>Ke azɔ la, Oo Zerubabel, lé dzi ɖe ƒo eye nàdo ŋusẽ nu’ Yehowae gblɔe. ‘Sẽ ŋu, Oo Yosua, Yehozadak ƒe avi, nunɔlagã, sẽ ŋu, mi anyigbadzitɔwo katã eye miawɔ dɔ.’ Yehowae gblɔe. ‘Elabena nye la meli kpli mi.’ Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae gblɔe. <verse eid="HAG 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 2:5"/>‘Esiae nye nu si mebla kpli mi esi miedo go tso Egipte be, nye Gbɔgbɔ la anɔ mia me. Migavɔ̃ o.’<verse eid="HAG 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 2:6"/>“Esiae nye nya si Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la, gblɔ, ‘Madidi o la, maʋuʋu dziƒo kple anyigba, atsiaƒu kple ƒuƒuiƒe siaa. <verse eid="HAG 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 2:7"/>Maʋuʋu dukɔwo katã, woatsɔ woƒe kesinɔnuwo ava afii eye gbedoxɔ la ayɔ kple ŋutikɔkɔe.’ Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae gblɔe. <verse eid="HAG 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 2:8"/>‘Klosalo la tɔnyee, eye sika hã tɔnyee.’ Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae gblɔe. <verse eid="HAG 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 2:9"/>‘Gbedoxɔ yeye la ƒe atsyɔ̃ gbɔ gbedoxɔ xoxoa ƒe atsyɔ̃ ŋu sãa.’ Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae gblɔe. ‘Eye le teƒe sia makɔ nye ŋutifafa ɖo.’ Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae gblɔe.”<verse eid="HAG 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yayrawo na ame siwo ŋuti mekɔ o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 2:10"/>Le ɣleti asiekɛlia ƒe ŋkeke blaeve-vɔ-enelia dzi le Fia Darius ƒe ƒe evelia me la, Yehowa ƒe gbe va na Nyagblɔɖila Hagai be, <verse eid="HAG 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 2:11"/>“Ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi: ‘Mibia nu si se la gblɔ la nunɔlawo, <verse eid="HAG 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 2:12"/>ne mia dometɔ aɖe tsɔ lã kɔkɔe aɖe xatsa ɖe eƒe awu me, eye wògblɔ be lã kɔkɔe sia ka abolo alo detsi, wain, ami alo nuɖuɖu bubu aɖe ŋuti la, ɖe wòwɔ nu siawo kɔkɔea?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAG 2:12">Nunɔlaawo ɖo eŋu be, “Ao.”<verse eid="HAG 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 2:13"/>Hagai gabia be, “Ekema ne ame aɖe ka asi ame kuku ŋuti, eye wòzu ame makɔmakɔ, hafi wòka asi nuɖuɖu siawo ƒe ɖe ŋuti la, ɖe nu siawo hã zu nu makɔmakɔa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAG 2:13">Nunɔlaawo ɖo eŋu be, “Ɛ̃, wozu nu makɔmakɔwo.”<verse eid="HAG 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 2:14"/>Azɔ Hagai gblɔ na wo be, “Yehowa be nenema ame siawo kple dukɔ sia le le nye ŋkume. Nu sia nu si miewɔ kple nu sia nu si mietsɔ sa vɔe la ŋuti mekɔ o.” Yehowae gblɔe.<verse eid="HAG 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 2:15"/>“ ‘Eya ta, mibu ta me le nu siawo ŋu nyuie tso fifia yina, mibu ale si nuwo nɔ hafi woɖo kpe ɖe kpe dzi hena Yehowa ƒe gbedoxɔ la tutu ŋu. <verse eid="HAG 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAG 2:16"/>Tsã la, ne miedzidze bli dzidzenu blaeve da ɖi eye emegbe ne mietrɔ yi ɖadzidzee la dzidzenu ewo ko wòtsina. Nenema ke, le wainfiaƒe, ne miedzidze wain ahago blaatɔ̃ da ɖi la, ahago blaeve ko wòtsina ne miegayi ɖadzidzee. <verse eid="HAG 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAG 2:17"/>Meda tohehe ɖe miaƒe asinudɔwɔwɔwo katã dzi kple ŋɔviwo, ale miaƒe bli gblẽ le agble dzi eye tsikpe dza ɖe miaƒe nukuwo dzi gake miegbe tɔtrɔ ɖe ŋunye.’ Yehowae gblɔe.<verse eid="HAG 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAG 2:18"/>“ ‘Ke tso egbe, ɣleti asiekɛlia ƒe ŋkeke blaeve-vɔ-enelia dzi, gbe si gbe woɖo Yehowa ƒe gbedoxɔ gɔme anyi la, milé ŋku ɖe eŋu nyuie. Mibu eŋu kpɔ: <verse eid="HAG 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAG 2:19"/>Ɖe nuku siwo woƒãna la ƒe ɖewo ganɔ ava mea? Va se ɖe fifia la, wainka, gboti, yevuboɖati kple amiti metse ku haɖe o.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAG 2:19">“ ‘Gake tso egbeŋkeke sia dzi la, mayra mi.’ ”<verse eid="HAG 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zerubabel, Yehowa ƒe ŋkɔsigɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAG 2:20"/>Yehowa ƒe gbe va na Hagai zi evelia le ɣletia ƒe ŋkeke blaeve-vɔ-enelia dzi be, <verse eid="HAG 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HAG 2:21"/>“Gblɔ na Zerubabel, Yudatɔwo ƒe anyigbadziɖulagã la be, maʋuʋu dziƒo kple anyigba. <verse eid="HAG 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HAG 2:22"/>Mamu fiaɖuƒewo ƒe fiazikpuiwo aƒu anyi eye makaka dzronyigbadzifiaɖuƒewo. Mamu tasiaɖamwo kple wo me nɔlawo aƒu anyi eye sɔwo kple wo dolawo atsrɔ̃ eye ame sia ame atsi ehavi ƒe yi nu.”<verse eid="HAG 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HAG 2:23"/>Ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi, “ ‘Le ŋkeke ma dzi la, matsɔ wò, nye dɔla Zerubabel, Sealtiel ƒe vi, Yehowae gblɔe eye mawɔ wò nye ŋkɔsigɛe elabena metia wò.’ Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae gblɔe.”<verse eid="HAG 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 2"/>
</usx>
